# This repository sets the standard for the others, so it follows it.
#
# Everything here is inherited by every repository in the organisation, which
# means a careless change to it lands everywhere at once.
*                           @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers

# Policy documents. Changing these changes the rules for every contributor.
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md         @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers
/GOVERNANCE.md              @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers
/SECURITY.md                @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers
/REPOSITORY-STANDARD.md     @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers

# Inherited by every repository that has none of its own. Note that issue
# template inheritance is all-or-nothing per directory - see
# REPOSITORY-STANDARD.md.
/.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/    @Guys-Inc-Public/maintainers
